<title>CHINA: Alenia in deal to sell five ATR-72s to China.</title>
<headline>Alenia in deal to sell five ATR-72s to China.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alenia of Italy's Finmeccanica has reached an agreement to sell five ATR-72 aircraft to China, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The planes were expected to be sold to Xinjiang Airlines, which operates out of the northwestern city of Urumqi.  </p>
<p>Alenia is part of an aircraft marketing consortium that also includes BAE Plc.</p>
<p>The value of the deal, expected to be signed later on Thursday, was not immediately known.</p>
</text>
